               <text>
                  <paragraph>carnauba wax, crospovidone, FD&amp;C red no. 40, hypromellose, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, povidone, pregelatinized starch, propylene glycol, sodium starch glycolate, stearic acid, titanium dioxide</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250922"/>
            </section>
         </component>
